。","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/luyrsbntgyeg7a9v5tvd4vbuywaxwl0.mp3","text":"那些家伙，就是要驱逐的人？","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/2y7y3d25mevwl7cest5qbq77cszslpj.mp3","text":"知道了。","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/chzdpdkiujsn6zxey28lqemww9h4452.mp3","text":"别催促。","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/n1yu6fwizkv332bgq13l1p1z51ls3vf.mp3","text":"这里的空气好浑浊。","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/o6e5j47zjaqm6f4ttf0ogs6o3xxpatt.mp3","text":"哼，就帮你这一次。","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/cy9ml7mo33fbvhgd67zc1dnde0v5ryr.mp3","text":"你们也想听睡前故事吗？","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/laxqwmn4ltv2n8xig34cldma5hg34b7.mp3","text":"不可通过！","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/26/79su1vubaxo8xw0f6sy54eidrby0mrm.mp3","text":"无礼之徒！","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/fllxgncj7tf3rc1fz8a5y8f0cxbpb9n.mp3","text":"看到什么梦境了吗？","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/ki9fsxqva5g0cbh5j3kofwpanp4en9b.mp3","text":"怎么样，我把那些人全都赶走了！","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/65li5cpecj9tepl27mkxp4wiufwu40p.mp3","text":"原来这就是胜利的滋味，但是，为什么我却没法感到开心呢......","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/a0t312d6t6vfbtrtap0pct3h5kmgbos.mp3","text":"咦，他们主动离开了，这样不就好了吗。","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/c7zzju1nojnraxb5smbxoftzancerxp.mp3","text":"什么呀，你是睡着了吗？！快跟我走呀！","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/ei8nx0di9rh70lx9b1etipn0j8ftbj6.mp3","text":"真是奇怪的地方，就没有更大一点的床了吗？","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/8yz6yg4dxmak96m0ww5zzb3b0n85w4h.mp3","text":"啊，我的扇子！还给我！","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/dzsreztvb9f903gtoskyuwn4hgj6k8f.mp3","text":"小心一些，不要弄乱我的头饰......嗯，没错，就这样梳......","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/5i8uun1tmskauft4ynu2dce41438jun.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/mervau49hxumhp8azzzpllmfiomle93.mp3","text":"又过了一年，这种时间流逝的感觉，总让我感到有些害怕。孩子们会在年复一年中逐渐长大，可是，这是好的事情吗？博士，长大......是一件好事吗？","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:9/95/95him6nabcgkbnxv51pbt3h6askmp6z.mp3","text":"日安，博士。","alt":"voice/char_338_iris/cn_042.mp3"}]}}